                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>Skillbook Skill Development Centre Hosts Inspiring Independence Day Event
                                    On August 14, 2024, Skillbook Skill Development Centre organized a vibrant Independence Day celebration at their campus in Rohini, Sector 6, New Delhi. The event was graced by the honorable MLA Mohendar Goyal, who attended as the chief guest. The celebration aimed to honor the nation’s independence while showcasing the talents of Skillbook’s students through various performances.
                                    The event saw enthusiastic participation from the students, who performed a series of patriotic dances and engaging roleplays, adding to the spirit of national pride. It wasn’t just a student affair; people from the surrounding community were also deeply involved, making the event a true celebration of unity and cultural heritage.
                                    MLA Mohendar Goyal, along with Skillbook's founders Mr. Aashish and Mrs. Pooja, took the opportunity to encourage the students for their excellent performances. Medals were distributed to recognize the students' hard work, achievements, and progress at Skillbook, adding to the joyous atmosphere.
                                    The event highlighted not only the importance of independence but also emphasized the role of education in uplifting society. Skillbook Skill Development Centre, through this celebration, continues to inspire both students and the community, reinforcing their commitment to skill development and societal welfare.
                                    The Independence Day celebration at Skillbook was a resounding success, combining patriotism, talent, and community spirit, leaving a lasting impression on all who attended.
                                    </p>
